# Unsupported by this Level 0 template

Generated from the NDP-02 contract. Unsupported features produce no stub API,
permission declaration, simulated result or claim of compatibility.

- Window creation, UI toolkit, rendering, input and accessibility backends.
- Runtime file-handle access, IPC transport, network, audio, clipboard and notifications.
- Runtime lifecycle delivery, state storage and capability-service adapters.
- Public Action registration, Context, Search and AI integration.
- Executable emission, .xapp construction/signing, install and launch.
- Windows/Linux API or GUI framework compatibility and Nagi target acceptance.

The SDK has host-testable identity, lifecycle, state and IPC contract types;
these are not connected runtime services. This template uses identity only.
resources, intents and requestedCapabilities are empty. A manifest declaration
never grants authority. No test signing key or first-party identity is copied.
